# Scenario timeout-budget (plan 04-20, D-20, D-21): outcome timeout, exit 11, detail budget. The
# original diagnostic expected to halt within 100 CPU cycles; it needs about 521, so the run-to
# bound is reached first: the deterministic machine-time budget, never wall time.
# expect-detail: budget step=1 line=11 expected=halted got=target
ivss 1
id timeout-budget
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec boot-stub
content grom zero-grom
content cart diag-cpu-1.ivsc
run-to 100 cpu-cycles stop halted
assert halted == yes
